# Test references are compared byte for byte: git keeps their line breaks (CRLF, LF and lone CR) and trailing white
# space as they are, whatever core.autocrlf is, and does not report them as whitespace errors. Their checksums are in
# SHA256SUMS next to them (ADR 0016).
*.wrapped    -text -whitespace linguist-generated
*.unwrapped  -text -whitespace
SHA256SUMS   -text
